logs/*.txt

# R
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/

# Misc
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.gz
*.bz2

# The anti-ageing review is a deliberately complete reproducibility package.
# Re-include its source data and audit exports despite the generic data rules
# above; licensed/local full-text caches remain excluded below.
!anti_ageing_review/
!anti_ageing_review/**/
!anti_ageing_review/**
anti_ageing_review/**/open_text_cache/
anti_ageing_review/**/open_text_cache/**
anti_ageing_review/**/pmc_fulltext/
anti_ageing_review/**/pmc_fulltext/**
anti_ageing_review/**/.pytest_cache/
anti_ageing_review/**/.pytest_cache/**
anti_ageing_review/**/__pycache__/
anti_ageing_review/**/__pycache__/**
anti_ageing_review/**/tmp_proof_render/
anti_ageing_review/**/tmp_proof_render/**
anti_ageing_review/**/proof_review_outputs/
anti_ageing_review/**/proof_review_outputs/**
